## 7. Vercel Hobby Plan Serverless Function Quota Architecture (<= 12 Functions Limit)

### Root Cause Analysis of "No more than 12 Serverless Functions can be added to a Deployment on the Hobby plan"
1. **The Vercel Serverless Function Quota**:
   - On the Vercel Hobby (free) tier, deployments enforce a strict hard limit of **at most 12 Serverless Functions per project**.
   - Vercel automatically treats every top-level `.ts`/`.js` file inside `/api/` (and its subdirectories, excluding files starting with `_`) as an individual Serverless Function Lambda.
   - When auth endpoints were maintained as 9 individual files (`send-otp.ts`, `verify-otp.ts`, `forgot-password.ts`, `reset-password.ts`, `verify-password.ts`, `check-security-status.ts`, `report-failed-login.ts`, `report-successful-login.ts`, and `[action].ts`) alongside 7 other API routes (`apps.ts`, `apps/[appId].ts`, `download-apk.ts`, `resolve-apk.ts`, `search.ts`, `health.ts`, `github-release-meta.ts`), the total function count reached **16 Serverless Functions**, exceeding the limit by 4 and completely aborting the build (`Build Failed: No more than 12 Serverless Functions can be added`).

2. **The Consolidated Dynamic Action Pattern**:
   - Consolidated all authentication, OTP, password verification, lockout reporting, and session management endpoints into a single dynamic router: `/api/auth/[action].ts`.
   - Vercel routes all `/api/auth/:action` calls directly to `api/auth/[action].ts`.
   - Deleted all 8 legacy redundant individual endpoint files in `api/auth/`.
   - Total Serverless Function count is reduced to **8 functions** (well under the 12-function limit):
     1. `api/auth/[action].ts` (All authentication & OTP operations)
     2. `api/apps.ts` (App catalog & single app lookup)
     3. `api/apps/[appId].ts` (Direct app document resolution)
     4. `api/download-apk.ts` (Download streaming & binary proxy)
     5. `api/resolve-apk.ts` (GitHub release & package resolver)
     6. `api/search.ts` (Universal search index)
     7. `api/health.ts` (Status & monitoring)
     8. `api/github-release-meta.ts` (Release metadata ingestion)
   - Guarantees 100% build compatibility with Vercel Hobby tier while preserving full API backwards-compatibility for frontend callers.

