## 10. Standardized Prople HTML Email Template & Dual-Engine Fallback

### A. Architectural Goals
1. Deliver GitHub-grade HTML email aesthetics matching production mobile Gmail standards (dark theme `#0d1117` / `#161b22`, spaced monospace code `0 3 6 9 4 1 0 1`, and primary action CTA buttons).
2. Embed Schema.org Email Markup (`EmailMessage` with `ConfirmAction`) so mobile Gmail renders the native interactive `Copy code: [OTP]` action button directly in the inbox thread and message header.
3. Ensure 100% email delivery via dual engines:
   - Primary: Resend API with custom branded domains (`The Prople Team <auth@prople.co.in>`).
   - Dual Fallback: Google Firebase Identity Toolkit REST API (`accounts:sendOobCode`) using project API key, guaranteeing instant delivery without external API key prerequisites.
4. Route all password reset and email verification links strictly to authorized domain `https://www.prople.co.in` via `actionCodeSettings`.
5. Enforce zero provider leakage: No mention of "Resend", "API Key", or internal vendor infrastructure in user-facing toasts or error diagnostics.
